                <div class="news-item">
                    <span class="news-date">Jun '25</span>
                    <span>Joined <a href="https://spindlequantum.com" target="_blank">Spindle Quantum</a> as a Software Engineer (SDE-I), working on vehicle routing and fleet optimization!</span>
