                <div class="news-item">
                    <span class="news-date">Apr '25</span>
                    <span>Graduated with an Integrated BS-MS in Data Science and Engineering from <a href="https://www.iiserb.ac.in/" target="_blank">IISER Bhopal</a>!</span>
                </div>
