                <div class="entry">
                    <div class="entry-logo"><img src="/images/iitpatna.png" alt="IIT Patna logo" loading="lazy"></div>
                    <div class="entry-body">
                        <papertitle style="color:gray"><big>Winter Intern</big></papertitle> <papertitle><big> | Indian Institute of Technology Patna</big></papertitle>
                        <div class="entry-date">Dec '22 - Jan '23</div>
                        <p>Worked under the supervision of <a href="https://www.iitp.ac.in/~sriparna/" target="_blank">Dr. Sriparna Saha</a> on Explaining Stereotypes behind Cyberbullying Memes via Knowledge Enhanced Text Generation.</p>
