                    <div class="entry-body">
                        <papertitle><big>Dynamic Vehicle Routing &amp; Fleet Optimization System</big></papertitle>
                        <ul>
                            <li>Designed and developed an event-driven DVRP engine with stateful route management, supporting pickup-delivery, time windows, heterogeneous fleets, multi-depot operations, vehicle/driver constraints, and dynamic events including new orders, cancellations, traffic delays and vehicle breakdowns.</li>
                            <li>Architected a hierarchical optimization framework with a Trigger Decision Engine for event-driven optimization decisions, cost-aware insertion, vehicle- and region-level re-optimization, and QUBO-based global optimization; integrated state versioning, OSRM routing, FastAPI, and MongoDB/Firestore persistence.</li>
                        </ul>
                    </div>
                </div>

            </div>
        </section>
